{"_meta":{"purpose":"National parks & reserves of national significance — data + real boundaries for the 'Sanctuaires' map layer.","count":9,"sources":"Boundaries: OpenStreetMap relations (ODbL), simplified. Areas/dates/UNESCO status: UNESCO World Heritage Centre, Wikipedia park articles, ICCN. Species status: IUCN categories as commonly reported. Images: Wikipedia/Wikimedia Commons.","caveat":"Boundaries are simplified for web display and are indicative, not legal limits. Species lists are flagship selections, not complete inventories.","attribution_required":"Boundary data © OpenStreetMap contributors (ODbL) — display this credit in the parks layer."},"parks":[{"id":"virunga","name":"Parc national des Virunga","name_en":"Virunga National Park","established":1925,"area_km2":7800,"provinces":["Nord-Kivu"],"territoires":["Beni","Lubero","Rutshuru","Nyiragongo","Masisi"],"unesco_year":1979,"danger_since":1994,"danger_period":null,"iucn_category":"II","tagline_fr":"Le plus ancien parc national d'Afrique.","tagline_en":"Africa's oldest national park.","summary_fr":"Créé en 1925, Virunga s'étend du lac Édouard aux neiges du Rwenzori et abrite deux volcans actifs, le Nyiragongo et le Nyamuragira. C'est l'aire protégée la plus riche en biodiversité d'Afrique — et l'une des plus dangereuses à protéger : des centaines de gardes y ont perdu la vie.","summary_en":"Created in 1925, Virunga stretches from Lake Edward to the snows of the Rwenzori and holds two active volcanoes, Nyiragongo and Nyamuragira. It is Africa's most biodiverse protected area — and one of the most dangerous to defend: hundreds of rangers have died there.","species":[{"fr":"Gorille de montagne","en":"Mountain gorilla","status":"critique"},{"fr":"Okapi","en":"Okapi","status":"en danger"},{"fr":"Hippopotame","en":"Hippopotamus","status":"vulnérable"},{"fr":"Chimpanzé","en":"Chimpanzee","status":"en danger"}],"features_fr":["Volcan Nyiragongo et son lac de lave","Monts Rwenzori (5 109 m)","Lac Édouard"],"threats_fr":["Groupes armés","Braconnage","Charbon de bois","Pressions pétrolières"],"fact_fr":"Son lac de lave, au sommet du Nyiragongo, est le plus grand du monde.","fact_en":"Its lava lake, atop Nyiragongo, is the largest in the world.","image":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/2b/Virunga_National_Park-107997.jpg/1280px-Virunga_National_Park-107997.jpg","image_credit":"Wikimedia Commons","image_subject":null,"centroid":[-0.398,29.504],"geometry":{"type":"MultiPolygon","coordinates":[[[[29.037,-1.318],[29.048,-1.302],[29.082,-1.295],[29.101,-1.312],[29.113,-1.29],[29.163,-1.296],[29.22,-1.26],[29.29,-1.256],[29.285,-1.192],[29.31,-1.169],[29.324,-1.075],[29.296,-1.075],[29.264,-1.022],[29.226,-1.005],[29.213,-0.981],[29.239,-0.898],[29.175,-0.881],[29.173,-0.86],[29.211,-0.779],[29.207,-0.7],[29.275,-0.6],[29.282,-0.548],[29.269,-0.527],[29.286,-0.515],[29.302,-0.449],[29.406,-0.317],[29.409,-0.282],[29.446,-0.238],[29.462,-0.185],[29.494,-0.16],[29.447,-0.149],[29.424,-0.168],[29.406,-0.161],[29.411,-0.094],[29.434,-0.087],[29.498,-0.143],[29.505,-0.1],[29.522,-0.085],[29.509,-0.04],[29.541,-0.002],[29.526,0.046],[29.504,0.064],[29.467,0.31],[29.476,0.358],[29.531,0.457],[29.53,0.551],[29.504,0.582],[29.534,0.577],[29.576,0.599],[29.591,0.631],[29.638,0.646],[29.669,0.677],[29.758,0.785],[29.756,0.841],[29.801,0.867],[29.866,0.853],[29.905,0.879],[29.897,0.84],[29.918,0.835],[29.928,0.907],[29.961,0.933],[29.967,0.895],[30.004,0.851],[29.989,0.846],[29.967,0.781],[29.865,0.746],[29.86,0.727],[29.794,0.701],[29.743,0.646],[29.803,0.59],[29.79,0.532],[29.811,0.516],[29.874,0.573],[29.937,0.539],[29.968,0.575],[29.982,0.557],[29.98,0.516],[29.873,0.386],[29.831,0.205],[29.768,0.212],[29.768,0.232],[29.793,0.232],[29.81,0.252],[29.742,0.308],[29.755,0.321],[29.775,0.301],[29.775,0.434],[29.718,0.435],[29.664,0.495],[29.651,0.477],[29.598,0.461],[29.593,0.428],[29.569,0.406],[29.603,0.375],[29.604,0.325],[29.641,0.304],[29.667,0.308],[29.68,0.219],[2