pe found only in the DRC. Removed from the World Heritage in Danger list in 2021 — one of the rare good-news stories in Congolese conservation.","species":[{"fr":"Bonobo","en":"Bonobo","status":"en danger"},{"fr":"Éléphant de forêt","en":"Forest elephant","status":"critique"},{"fr":"Paon congolais","en":"Congo peafowl","status":"vulnérable"},{"fr":"Faux-gavial d'Afrique","en":"African slender-snouted crocodile","status":"critique"}],"features_fr":["Rivières Salonga et Lomela","Forêt inondée de la cuvette centrale"],"threats_fr":["Braconnage","Accès très difficile","Financement"],"fact_fr":"Retirée de la liste du patrimoine en péril en 2021, après 22 ans.","fact_en":"Removed from the World Heritage in Danger list in 2021, after 22 years.","image":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/5/54/La_rivi%C3%A8re_Lulilaka%2C_parc_national_de_Salonga%2C_2005.jpg","image_credit":"Wikimedia Commons","image_subject":null,"centroid":[-2.148,21.321],"geometry":{"type":"MultiPolygon","coordinates":[[[[20.673,-1.176],[20.732,-1.024],[20.755,-1.021],[20.792,-1.027],[20.811,-1.059],[20.843,-1.059],[20.841,-1.073],[20.902,-1.082],[20.945,-1.055],[20.977,-1.094],[21.035,-1.076],[21.104,-1.133],[21.125,-1.129],[21.168,-1.153],[21.188,-1.145],[21.191,-1.165],[21.254,-1.204],[21.297,-1.208],[21.308,-1.226],[21.361,-1.234],[21.372,-1.252],[21.393,-1.244],[21.405,-1.272],[21.449,-1.276],[21.48,-1.312],[21.531,-1.312],[21.574,-1.359],[21.641,-1.382],[21.696,-1.342],[21.733,-1.346],[21.737,-1.334],[21.801,-1.321],[21.89,-1.188],[21.907,-1.199],[21.923,-1.175],[21.953,-1.242],[21.988,-1.245],[21.984,-1.266],[21.994,-1.279],[22.008,-1.27],[22.007,-1.299],[22.031,-1.29],[22.03,-1.33],[22.068,-1.333],[22.082,-1.343],[22.074,-1.361],[22.115,-1.371],[22.119,-1.388],[22.145,-1.382],[22.183,-1.4],[22.193,-1.431],[22.261,-1.434],[22.266,-1.459],[22.305,-1.47],[22.291,-1.479],[22.302,-1.496],[22.319,-1.504],[22.328,-1.489],[22.329,-1.512],[22.369,-1.518],[22.391,-1.581],[22.415,-1.578],[22.408,