jourd'hui disparu du parc. Elle abrite encore l'unique population de girafes du Kordofan de la RDC et une population d'éléphants qui se reconstitue lentement après des décennies de braconnage industriel.","summary_en":"A vast wooded savannah in the northeast, Garamba was the last refuge of the northern white rhino, now gone from the park. It still holds the DRC's only Kordofan giraffe population and an elephant herd slowly recovering after decades of industrial poaching.","species":[{"fr":"Girafe du Kordofan","en":"Kordofan giraffe","status":"critique"},{"fr":"Éléphant de savane","en":"Savannah elephant","status":"en danger"},{"fr":"Hippopotame","en":"Hippopotamus","status":"vulnérable"},{"fr":"Lion","en":"Lion","status":"vulnérable"}],"features_fr":["Savanes à hautes herbes","Rivière Garamba","Domaines de chasse annexes"],"threats_fr":["Braconnage à l'ivoire","Groupes armés (LRA historiquement)","Transhumance armée"],"fact_fr":"Créée en 1938, elle abrita la seule station de domestication d'éléphants au monde.","fact_en":"Founded in 1938, it hosted the world's only elephant domestication station.","image":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/1/1d/Garamba_National_Park_overhead.jpg","image_credit":"Wikimedia Commons","image_subject":null,"centroid":[4.145,29.493],"geometry":{"type":"Polygon","coordinates":[[[28.946,3.828],[28.96,3.849],[29.002,3.838],[29.022,3.861],[29.025,3.849],[29.046,3.881],[29.081,3.865],[29.085,3.891],[29.113,3.907],[29.111,3.927],[29.134,3.922],[29.14,3.87],[29.165,3.867],[29.167,3.887],[29.206,3.881],[29.212,3.925],[29.232,3.935],[29.23,4.001],[29.258,4.026],[29.26,4.073],[29.234,4.108],[29.242,4.175],[29.307,4.235],[29.279,4.262],[29.28,4.317],[29.387,4.423],[29.424,4.427],[29.515,4.487],[29.52,4.534],[29.566,4.569],[29.536,4.589],[29.52,4.633],[29.532,4.657],[29.555,4.672],[29.601,4.65],[29.623,4.659],[29.71,4.617],[29.745,4.57],[29.764,4.588],[29.794,4.561],[29.828,4.558],[29.8,4.52],[29.81,4.501],[29.8,4.373],[29.842,4.335],[29