","tagline_fr":"Trois espèces endémiques, presque aucun visiteur.","tagline_en":"Three endemic species, almost no visitors.","summary_fr":"L'un des parcs les plus isolés et les moins étudiés du pays. La Maiko réunit à elle seule trois espèces emblématiques que la RDC est seule à posséder : le gorille de Grauer, l'okapi et le paon congolais. Son inaccessibilité l'a protégée autant qu'elle l'a laissée sans surveillance.","summary_en":"One of the country's most isolated and least studied parks. Maiko alone holds three flagship species found only in the DRC: the Grauer's gorilla, the okapi and the Congo peafowl. Its inaccessibility has protected it as much as it has left it unwatched.","species":[{"fr":"Gorille de Grauer","en":"Grauer's gorilla","status":"critique"},{"fr":"Okapi","en":"Okapi","status":"en danger"},{"fr":"Paon congolais","en":"Congo peafowl","status":"vulnérable"}],"features_fr":["Forêt primaire de basse altitude","Bordure occidentale du rift Albertin"],"threats_fr":["Groupes armés (Simba)","Orpaillage","Absence de surveillance"],"fact_fr":"Seul parc à réunir les trois grandes espèces endémiques congolaises.","fact_en":"The only park holding all three of the DRC's flagship endemic species.","image":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/3a/Saint-Aignan_%28Loir-et-Cher%29._Okapi.jpg/1280px-Saint-Aignan_%28Loir-et-Cher%29._Okapi.jpg","image_credit":"Wikimedia Commons","image_subject":"Okapi","centroid":[-0.413,27.582],"geometry":{"type":"Polygon","coordinates":[[[27.271,-0.991],[27.238,-0.912],[27.105,-0.891],[27.087,-0.799],[27.034,-0.774],[26.896,-0.79],[26.845,-0.758],[26.931,-0.702],[26.983,-0.554],[26.932,-0.501],[26.947,-0.424],[26.93,-0.36],[26.944,-0.308],[27.003,-0.246],[26.988,-0.235],[26.971,-0.249],[26.926,-0.219],[26.972,-0.147],[27.012,-0.123],[27.063,-0.137],[27.188,-0.223],[27.451,-0.141],[27.493,-0.138],[27.504,-0.157],[27.525,-0.15],[27.616,-0.18],[27.633,-0.142],[27.671,-0.156],[27.68,-0.071],[27.741,-0.057],[27.739,-0.0