w out of fieldwork carried out with local communities. It is where the lesula was identified, a monkey formally described in 2012 — one of the century's rare African primate discoveries.","species":[{"fr":"Lesula","en":"Lesula","status":"vulnérable"},{"fr":"Bonobo","en":"Bonobo","status":"en danger"},{"fr":"Okapi","en":"Okapi","status":"en danger"},{"fr":"Paon congolais","en":"Congo peafowl","status":"vulnérable"}],"features_fr":["Rivière Lomami","Forêts et savanes incluses","Créé avec les communautés locales"],"threats_fr":["Braconnage","Orpaillage","Pression agricole"],"fact_fr":"Le lesula, décrit en 2012, ne vit qu'entre la Lomami et le Tshuapa.","fact_en":"The lesula, described in 2012, lives only between the Lomami and the Tshuapa.","image":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/7/76/Cercopithecus_lomamiensis_%28Lesula%29.png","image_credit":"Wikimedia Commons","image_subject":"Lesula","centroid":[-1.745,25.049],"geometry":{"type":"Polygon","coordinates":[[[24.826,-1.089],[24.838,-1.119],[24.87,-1.137],[24.937,-1.11],[24.997,-1.052],[24.987,-1.004],[25.037,-0.956],[25.042,-0.92],[25.326,-0.932],[25.31,-0.995],[25.264,-1.037],[25.267,-1.073],[25.249,-1.102],[25.258,-1.146],[25.225,-1.144],[25.206,-1.192],[25.187,-1.259],[25.221,-1.275],[25.192,-1.296],[25.169,-1.344],[25.169,-1.36],[25.302,-1.482],[25.292,-1.565],[25.317,-1.665],[25.385,-1.724],[25.385,-1.838],[25.44,-1.859],[25.369,-1.967],[25.401,-1.981],[25.402,-2.056],[25.435,-2.106],[25.417,-2.11],[25.411,-2.174],[25.33,-2.245],[25.348,-2.449],[25.299,-2.486],[25.268,-2.572],[25.228,-2.619],[25.225,-2.681],[25.193,-2.759],[25.228,-2.866],[25.29,-2.957],[25.282,-2.972],[25.295,-2.994],[25.264,-3.076],[25.177,-3.064],[25.093,-2.954],[25.021,-2.941],[25.105,-2.815],[25.116,-2.774],[25.076,-2.703],[25.094,-2.636],[25.002,-2.554],[25.048,-2.493],[25.001,-2.477],[25.064,-2.424],[25.05,-2.391],[25.101,-2.357],[25.109,-2.319],[25.127,-2.315],[25.167,-2.253],[25.199,-2.261],[25.198,-2.242],[25.216,-2.234],[